{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URLComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The query subcomponent as an array of URLQueryItems."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"queryItems","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials12URLQueryItemV","text":"URLQueryItem","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/URLQueryItem"},{"text":"]? { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"set","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each "},{"code":"URLQueryItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" represents a single key-value pair,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that a name may appear more than once in a single query string, so the name values are not guaranteed to be unique. If the ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has an empty query component, returns an empty array. If the ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has no query component, returns nil.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The setter combines an array containing any number of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLQueryItem"},{"type":"text","text":"s, each of which represents a single key-value pair, into a query string and sets the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLComponents"},{"type":"text","text":" query property. Passing an empty array sets the query component of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLComponents"},{"type":"text","text":" to an empty string. Passing nil removes the query component of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLComponents"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a name-value pair in a query is empty (i.e. the query string starts with ‘&’, ends with ‘&’, or has “&&” within it), you get a "},{"code":"URLQueryItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with a zero-length name and a nil value. If a query’s name-value pair has nothing before the equals sign, you get a zero-length name. If a query’s name-value pair has nothing after the equals sign, you get a zero-length value. If a query’s name-value pair has no equals sign, the query name-value pair string is the name and you get a nil value."}]}],"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside"}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"10.10","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"9.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"2.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"queryItems","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"queryItems"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials12URLQueryItemV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"URLQueryItem"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?"}],"externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials13URLComponentsV10queryItemsSayAA12URLQueryItemVGSgvp"},"identifier":